# Recorded input for the switch page (widgets/switch.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 120 in the default
# theme: VSync (off) at y 12..30, HDR (on) at y 38..56 and Bloom (off) at y 64..82, tracks at
# x 12..44. One line per frame below (format: input.Replay). Scancodes: Space 44, Enter 40.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 120
dt 0.016
pointer 300 110
# 1: press VSync
frame
pointer 28 21
buttons left
# 2: release: on
frame
buttons
# 3: Space up on the focused VSync: off
frame
release 44
# 4: Enter does nothing
frame
press 40
# 5: press HDR
frame
pointer 28 47
buttons left
# 6: release: off
frame
buttons
# 7: Space down: nothing yet
frame
press 44
# 8: Space up: HDR on
frame
release 44
# 9: press Bloom, drag off, release: no flip
frame
pointer 28 73
buttons left
# 10: dragged off
frame
pointer 300 110
# 11: released off it
frame
buttons
